{"id":"64054515b205b16a","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-complexity-separation.md","title":"Distinct Sigma-1, Pi-1, and Boolean Degree Classes","display":"thm-degree-complexity-separation — Distinct Sigma-1, Pi-1, and Boolean Degree Classes","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-complexity-separation","aliases":["67-thm-degree-complexity-separation"],"display":"thm-degree-complexity-separation — Distinct Sigma-1, Pi-1, and Boolean Degree Classes","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","[[67-df-degree-structure]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§2","source_label":"Theorem 7.9(a)-(e)","source_printed_pages":[103,104],"source_pdf_pages":[114,115],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"book-proofs-read for (a),(b),(c),(e); (d) details left to reader and not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-complexity-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-complexity-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-complexity-separation — Distinct Sigma-1, Pi-1, and Boolean Degree Classes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.9(a)-(e)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>103</span><span>104</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>114</span><span>115</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"book-proofs-read for (a),(b),(c),(e); (d) details left to reader and not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a> 的定义与前提。</li>\n<li>所有集合差、交、并都在同一个度载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T\">\\(D_T\\)</span> 中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf S_T\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf S_T\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T\\setminus\\mathsf P_T\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_T\\setminus\\mathsf P_T\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf S_T\\cap\\mathsf P_T)\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathsf S_T\\cap\\mathsf P_T)\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B_T\\setminus(\\mathsf S_T\\cup\\mathsf P_T)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf B_T\\setminus(\\mathsf S_T\\cup\\mathsf P_T)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_T\\setminus\\mathsf B_T\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_T\\setminus\\mathsf B_T\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项对应原书第7章定理9(a)–(e)（印刷103–104页，PDF114–115页）。第四式说明有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1\">\\(B_1\\)</span> 度既非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 度也非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 度；第五式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1\">\\(B_1\\)</span> 度仍不能覆盖全部度。第三式保留两个端点排除条件，避免用平凡真句和矛盾句充当见证。</p>\n<p>已阅读(a)、(b)、(c)、(e)的原书论证及引理14–16；(d)在原书只给构造思路并将细节留给读者，本次没有补全这部分。前两类的分离使用不封顶关系、递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句序列；交集的非平凡见证来自互补自指的两句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句；非 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1\">\\(B_1\\)</span> 见证来自不断提高不封顶强度的句集。所有五条均为来源陈述核对，并非五条均已在笔记内独立证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 及 [[67-df-degree-structure]] 的定义与前提。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 及 [[67-df-degree-structure]] 的定义与前提。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T","display":false},{"tex":"D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf S_T\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_T\\setminus\\mathsf P_T\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathsf S_T\\cap\\mathsf P_T)\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf B_T\\setminus(\\mathsf S_T\\cup\\mathsf P_T)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"D_T\\setminus\\mathsf B_T\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"B_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"B_1","display":false},{"tex":